# FloppaOS Black: the colour scheme of FloppaOS.
# Based on KDE's Breeze Dark (https://invent.kde.org/plasma/breeze, colors/BreezeDark.colors, commit b0832e7,
# 2026-11-16). FloppaOS changes: pure-black backgrounds (OLED), pure-white text, black window title bars.
